 /* Program     : COTRN01C.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS PL/I Program                                    */
 /* Function    : Transaction Detail View                             */
 /* Converted from COBOL/CICS: app/cbl/COTRN01C.cbl                  */
